{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:db3910c60f56fba5","name":"Celegian Life-Support Chamber","source":{"id":"source:reference-db3910c60f56fba5","title":"Celegian Life-Support Chamber","revision":20371,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:43:26Z","sha256":"b5908d5a34f1040cb31dedf922feeb3699bdde00b39a3d5caa46b7a63a40b280","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20371","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Celegian%20Life-Support%20Chamber&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-db3910c60f56fba5","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Celegians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Celegians"}," rely on transplastseel life-support chambers to survive away from their homeworld. These chambers are filled with cyanogen gas and held aloft by the Celegian's natural levitation. A Celegian Life-Support Chamber possesses a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," of 10. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Celegian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Celegian","referenceId":"reference:f8555345419d08dd"}," encased in a Celegian Life-Support Chamber receives a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},", as well as increases their Fly Speed by +2 squares.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
